{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2fb0299edca8a2e10e52798f5247f34c1c086bfdb803b2ec306755066d89c418", "ja": "（遊園地で野外ライブをする事になった！\n今日はそのリハだ。ステージは滞りなく進み……）", "zh": "（决定在游乐园举办户外演唱会！今天是彩排。舞台顺利进行着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "3b59962399422c2c73a92adc116486c158086e0b0b71947d4dcca25668d57b64", "ja": "お疲れさま、{$P$}くん！\n私のカッコいいところ、ちゃんと見ててくれた？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}君！\n我帅气的一面，你有好好看着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0ac0800177f4fde6bbde2b28e02ff6d5d5de07e6ba1567cfb026dc7eac849242", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。この調子なら\n本番も盛り上がりそうだな。期待してるぞ！", "zh": "啊，当然。照这个势头，正式演出肯定也会很热闹。期待着哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "6a58df6fbd7c75bac0c21e6a9b023e1b8d34f609acae408d73fd0e5f1a4d820b", "ja": "もちろん、たくさん盛り上げちゃうんだから♪\nあー、本番が待ち遠しいわね～。", "zh": "那当然，我一定会把气氛炒得超级热闹的♪\n啊～真等不及要到演出了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "eae9e751eaa3b0eec003c8e30dd05ba9da56d440902824e821337a1d812d322f", "ja": "ねえ、ところで……今日ってもうおしまい？\nこの後、まだ時間があるみたいだけど……。", "zh": "对了，话说回来……今天已经结束了吗？\n之后好像还有时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2348c8d68c3a8745ac0c8d2ed64e3cb798be8df78769f90c8a1be9bb15a4cbf6", "ja": "ああ、うん。せっかく来たんだから、\nみんな遊びたいかと思って。時間作っといたよ。", "zh": "啊，嗯。难得大家都来了，\n我想大家可能还想玩玩，所以就腾出时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "a1de69cdc0a9702fe0342a4757ceabcea18ad426e90304b8435a8c3c604f03bf", "ja": "やった♪　さすが{$P$}くん！\nちょうど私、試したいことがあったのよ。", "zh": "太棒了♪　真不愧是{$P$}！\n我正好有件事想试试看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "0bdff13e297f896c74214b27bdae6a481f15ed913060961f0a58ce491a539765", "ja": "雑誌で読んだのよね……お化け屋敷でかわいく\n怖がれば、どんな男の子もイチコロだって！", "zh": "我在杂志上读到过……据说在鬼屋里可爱地害怕一下，就能让男孩子们一个个神魂颠倒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1008_p", "source_sha256": "03bf7a12f8bb6d995371199a192156e9be0d043941281271238efb4f930cd42a", "ja": "可愛く怖がる……。\nか弱いところを見せてアピールする、みたいな？", "zh": "可爱地表现出害怕……\n就像是展现出软弱的一面来吸引对方那样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "617d93d2313883a315a29e8e6e65600470c99d212b329017ec217ad20c5a44c3", "ja": "そうそう、つい守ってあげたくなるような感じ！\nそういうの得意じゃないけど、やってみようかなって。", "zh": "对对，就是那种让人忍不住想保护你的感觉！\n虽然我不擅长这个，不过还是想试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "89778b6e9077b8d3cc660b3f6d1285413ff047de3db064b14d1086f1bc6297ad", "ja": "ついでに腕を抱き寄せて、さりげないボディタッチを\nしたら、完璧！　オチない男はいない！だって。", "zh": "顺便挽住他的手臂，再若无其事地进行些肢体接触，\n这样就完美了！据说没有男人会不上钩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cec50adca37467e88c29c03d1f8addf48493f46ccd9e170e64b4cc47ad65f890", "ja": "まあ、わからなくはない、かな……？\nとにかく、自由時間って事で。楽しんできてくれ。", "zh": "倒也不是不能理解……吧？\n总之，就当作是自由活动时间。去好好玩一玩吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "67dbab3a2e1874fca2ee75744fa74d680c7ed13200c7cc3a0d5e5cb8706b9ea0", "ja": "ちょっとちょっと、なに他人事みたいに言ってるの！\nキミも来るのよ、{$P$}くん。", "zh": "等等，你这说得就像事不关己一样！\n你也要来哦，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0d3826d9487c7c78cd6dc2d257dc761a85e38a940413e02f92bcb786265dedf4", "ja": "えっ、俺？", "zh": "诶，我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "bccdcc181b4b8afc6e7f2ffe1fcced87283530141a30f2f29fb444d20e99b7a4", "ja": "相手役がいないと、意味ないじゃない。\n私の魅力を磨くために、付き合ってくれなきゃ！", "zh": "没有搭档的话，不就没意义了吗？\n为了磨炼我的魅力，你得陪我才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "ffa7e9600d614a482cbf7df6d1096cd41c9a3cde4fe3b062ec11c16aceaed803", "ja": "キミは私の担当プロデューサーでしょ？\nこんな美人を、ひとりで放っておく気～？", "zh": "你是负责我的制作人吧？\n难道要把我这样的美女一个人丢在这里不管吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1016_p", "source_sha256": "52bd109a97c1d947981d89f21f1448e43399499885835a50418fa0147389c509", "ja": "まあ、確かにほっとけない気はするな……。\nわかった、頑張るよ。", "zh": "嗯，确实有点没法放着不管……  \n知道了，我会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "7cfb1c67304b61c70f6db7a328642d9a5e3e846b3da0a4f4482c45704bc33893", "ja": "そうそう、その調子♪　よーし、じゃあ行くわよ！\nっと、その前に、着替えてくるわね。", "zh": "对对，就是这个劲头♪ 好了，那我们走吧！\n啊，先等一下，我去换身衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "00e74412957d61a242de531eee3498852900f32435ff4596650df5618c607174", "ja": "待ってなさい、お化け屋敷っ！　モテモテの\nテクニック、絶対にマスターしてみせるんだから。", "zh": "给我等着瞧吧，鬼屋！受人欢迎的\n技巧，我绝对要掌握给你看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3932e41612165893a9d04f3bbbb0ea6e6b2e2412ca64524d042b91458d100819", "ja": "あっ、莉緒、ここのお化け屋敷、確か日本一怖いって\n触れ込みで……って、行っちゃったか。", "zh": "啊，莉绪，这里的鬼屋可是号称全日本最恐怖……她已经进去了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1020_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "3c7adcfd306cbb7c0444d98bfac5d3bf2ccce953dd98de9eb6720812148595f6", "ja": "きゃああああーーっ！！？？", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊——！！？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0224_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b663a613c798639acf0cd6a42ba7c97a83c28398ec982e8307fc0732fd2da9d6", "ja": "（ギャアアアーッ！！？？）", "zh": "（呀啊啊啊——！！？？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
